  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: Bro, have you seen the new meme of Mr Gold on the internet? People are
      calling him the "King of Dan Phuong."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: "He\u2019s a legend, man. I\u2019m surprised you haven't charged people
      for taking photos with him yet."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: "I should, right? But I have to keep him in the back. Those kids on Exciters
      look way too interested in him, and I\u2019m not losing my best friend for
      a TikTok video."
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Smart move. Protect the King at all costs.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Brother Hai (Pho Seller)
    Text: "Exactly. He\u2019s the real boss of this shop, I just make the broth."
    Choices: []
